# Context for deploy/Dockerfile (stage 2; `just image` builds it from the repo
# root). Only the AE packages, the config and the agent specs (Phase 5,
# 2026-09-23) enter the image, so nothing else
# is sent to the daemon: the upstream submodule has its own context and its
# own .dockerignore, and a local checkout carries node_modules and a venv that
# would otherwise make the context hundreds of megabytes. Added 2026-09-23
# with the extension package, whose web/ directory has a node_modules of its own.
*
!packages/
!config/
!agents/
packages/**/node_modules/
packages/**/.venv/
packages/**/__pycache__/
packages/**/*.egg-info/
packages/**/.pytest_cache/
packages/**/.ruff_cache/
